# templates/v2/skills/ — local-only gitignore overlay.
#
# The parent templates/v2/.gitignore ignores `skills/**/*.local{,.skill.md}` —
# correct behaviour when that file is copied verbatim as `.devcontainer/.gitignore`
# in target projects (their runtime *.local skills must stay gitignored).
#
# In THIS dev-tools repo, templates/v2/skills/*.local/ is the source-of-truth
# for personal skills (hours.local, master-review.local, ...). Re-include them
# here. This file is NOT shipped: install.sh only copies named skill subdirs
# (`copy_dir "skills/$s"`) and `templates/v2/.gitignore`, never this file.

!*.local.skill.md
!*.local/
